@startuml UC02_play_minigame
title UC-02: Play Minigame - Diagrama de clases

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 70

' ============================================================
package "Presentación" {

  class DepartmentView {
    -department: Department
    -stats: StatisticsTracker
    --
    +select_department(department: Department): void
    +show_general_stats(stats: GeneralStats): void
    +show_upgrade_option(): void
    +show_detailed_stats(detail: DetailedStats): void
    -on_stat_selected(type: StatType): void
    -on_upgrade_pressed(): void
    -on_play_pressed(): void
  }

  note left of DepartmentView
    Pantalla del departamento (detalle en UC-11).
    on_play_pressed() abre SessionView con el
    departamento seleccionado (UC-02.1).
    Al volver (UC-02.9), select_department()
    muestra las estadísticas ya actualizadas.
  end note

  class SessionView {
    -session: SessionOrchestrator
    --
    +open(department: Department): void
    +show_minigame(minigame: Minigame): void
    +show_pause_menu(): void
    +hide_pause_menu(): void
    +show_save_error(): void
    +return_to_department(department: Department): void
    -on_pause_pressed(): void
    -on_resume_pressed(): void
    -on_exit_pressed(): void
  }

  note right of SessionView
    Se suscribe a las señales de SessionOrchestrator:
    minigame_started -> show_minigame        (UC-02.4)
    paused           -> show_pause_menu      (UC-02.4.a1.1)
    resumed          -> hide_pause_menu      (UC-02.4.a1.4)
    save_failed      -> show_save_error      (UC-02.8.e1)
    session_ended    -> return_to_department (UC-02.9)
    open() llama a start_session() (UC-02.1).
    return_to_department() vuelve a DepartmentView.
    Los botones llaman a pause(), resume() y exit().
    La lógica no conoce a la vista.
  end note
}

' ============================================================
package "Lógica" {

  class SessionOrchestrator <<B4>> {
    -department: Department
    -generic_minigames: List<String>
    -sequence: List<String>
    -current_index: int
    -current_minigame: Minigame
    -state: SessionState
    -results: List<MinigameResult>
    -pause_time_limit: float
    -pause_time_left: float
    --
    +start_session(department: Department): void
    +pause(): void
    +resume(): void
    +exit(): void
    -build_sequence(): void
    -create_minigame(type: String): Minigame
    -launch_next(): void
    -on_minigame_finished(result: MinigameResult): void
    -on_pause_timeout(): void
    -save_progress(): bool
    -end_session(): void
    .. señales ..
    +minigame_started(minigame: Minigame)
    +paused()
    +resumed()
    +save_failed()
    +session_ended(department: Department)
  }

  note left of SessionOrchestrator
    Orquestador de sesión (B4).
    start_session() (UC-02.1) -> build_sequence():
    específicos del departamento + genéricos (UC-02.2).
    launch_next() crea el minijuego y lo inicia con
    department + elo (UC-02.3 / UC-02.4).
    on_minigame_finished(): actualiza el ELO (B1) y
    registra la estadística (B6) (UC-02.5 / UC-02.6).
    Se repite hasta terminar la secuencia (UC-02.7).
    save_progress(): arma SaveData con el estado de
    B1 y B6 y lo entrega a B7 (UC-02.8).
    on_pause_timeout(): pausa demasiado larga
    (UC-02.4.a1.3.a1). exit(): salida anticipada
    (UC-02.4.a2). En ambos casos se aborta el
    minijuego actual y se guarda lo ya completado.
  end note

  enum SessionState {
    ACTIVE
    PAUSED
    ENDED
  }

  abstract class Minigame <<Contrato B3>> {
    #department: Department
    #elo: float
    #paused: bool
    --
    +{abstract} start(department: Department, elo: float): void
    +{abstract} pause(): void
    +{abstract} resume(): void
    +{abstract} abort(): void
    +{abstract} get_result(): MinigameResult
    .. señales ..
    +finished(result: MinigameResult)
  }

  note right of Minigame
    Contrato de minijuego (B3): el orquestador
    solo conoce esta interfaz.
    pause()/resume() preservan y restauran el
    estado (UC-02.4.a1.1 / UC-02.4.a1.4).
    abort() = terminar sin resultado.
  end note

  class QuizMinigame
  class SwipeMinigame

  note bottom of QuizMinigame
    Motores (B5): cada uno ejecuta su propio
    caso de uso (UC-03 a UC-10; Quiz: UC-07).
  end note

  class MinigameResult {
    -type: String
    -success: bool
    -level: Difficulty
    -department: Department
  }

  class DepartmentManager <<B1>> {
    -states: Map<Department, DepartmentState>
    -enabled_minigames: Map<Department, List<String>>
    -level_up_thresholds: Map<Department, float>
    --
    +get_elo(department: Department): float
    +get_enabled_minigames(department: Department): List<String>
    +update_elo(result: MinigameResult): void
    +can_level_up(department: Department): bool
    +get_all_states(): List<DepartmentState>
    -compute_elo_delta(result: MinigameResult): float
  }

  note bottom of DepartmentManager
    compute_elo_delta(): ajuste ponderado por la
    dificultad (acierto en dificultad alta suma más;
    error en dificultad alta resta menos).
    can_level_up() se usa en UC-11.
    enabled_minigames y level_up_thresholds son
    datos de autoría: no se persisten.
  end note

  class StatisticsTracker <<B6>> {
    -history: List<ResultRecord>
    --
    +register_result(result: MinigameResult): void
    +get_general_stats(department: Department): GeneralStats
    +get_detailed_stats(department: Department, type: StatType): DetailedStats
    +get_history(): List<ResultRecord>
    -records_of(department: Department): List<ResultRecord>
  }

  note bottom of StatisticsTracker
    register_result() crea un ResultRecord con el
    momento actual (UC-02.6).
    get_history() entrega el historial para
    guardarlo (UC-02.8).
    Las vistas general y detallada se usan en UC-11.
  end note
}

' ============================================================
package "Datos (Resources)" {

  class PersistenceService <<B7>> {
    +save_progress(data: SaveData): bool
  }

  note bottom of PersistenceService
    En UC-02 solo interviene al cerrar la sesión
    (UC-02.8). save_progress() retorna false si
    falla el guardado (UC-02.8.e1).
    El estado de la sesión en curso no se persiste.
  end note

  class SaveData {
    -department_states: List<DepartmentState>
    -history: List<ResultRecord>
  }

  class DepartmentState {
    -department: Department
    -level: int
    -elo: float
  }

  class ResultRecord {
    -department: Department
    -type: String
    -level: Difficulty
    -success: bool
    -timestamp: int
  }

  enum Department {
    DATA_STRUCTURES
    REQUIREMENTS
    SOFTWARE_DEV
    CODING
  }

  enum Difficulty {
    FACIL
    MEDIO
    DIFICIL
    MUY_DIFICIL
  }
}

' ============================================================
' Relaciones
DepartmentView ..> SessionView : abre (UC-02.1)
SessionView ..> DepartmentView : vuelve (UC-02.9)
DepartmentView "1" --> "1" StatisticsTracker : stats
SessionView "1" --> "1" SessionOrchestrator : session
SessionOrchestrator --> SessionState : state
SessionOrchestrator "1" --> "0..1" Minigame : current_minigame
SessionOrchestrator "1" --> "*" MinigameResult : results
SessionOrchestrator ..> DepartmentManager : ELO y minijuegos\nhabilitados
SessionOrchestrator ..> StatisticsTracker : registra resultado\n/ obtiene historial
SessionOrchestrator ..> SaveData : <<create>>
SessionOrchestrator ..> PersistenceService : guarda progreso
Minigame <|-- QuizMinigame
Minigame <|-- SwipeMinigame
Minigame ..> MinigameResult : produce
DepartmentManager "1" *-- "4" DepartmentState
StatisticsTracker "1" *-- "*" ResultRecord
SaveData "1" o-- "4" DepartmentState
SaveData "1" o-- "*" ResultRecord
Department -[hidden]right- Difficulty

@enduml